<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Apasco downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Apasco downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Kleinwort Benson said on Monday it had downgraded its rating of Mexican cement company Apasco S.A. de C.V. to long-term buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Stephen Hughes wrote Apasco has suffered a &quot;leakage&quot; of market share to Cemex S.A.. &quot;The company itself is now estimating a fall in operating margin in the fourth quarter to 23-25 percent, a sharp fall from the 29 percent levels of the previous two quarters.&quot;</p>
<p>-- He added, &quot;We recommend the switch into Cemex for the next quarter and downgrade Apasco&quot; to a long-term buy from buy.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
